Manage Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and Identity and Access Management (IAM) permissions.

Usage:
  confluent iam [command]

Available Commands:
  certificate-authority Manage certificate authorities.
  certificate-pool      Manage certificate pools.
  group-mapping         Manage SSO group mappings.
  identity-provider     Manage Confluent Cloud IAM identity providers.
  ip-filter             Manage IP filters.
  ip-group              Manage IP groups.
  pool                  Manage identity pools.
  rbac                  Manage RBAC permissions.
  service-account       Manage and select Confluent Cloud IAM service accounts.
  user                  Manage Confluent Cloud IAM users.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent iam [command] --help" for more information about a command.
